WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
WHEN RELIGION BECOMES AN OBSESSION, 
HUMANITY TURNS INTO BRUTALITY

2
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
(Song) The temple bell seeks peace...

3
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The mosque's prayer speaks of humanity...

4
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
The church's prayer preaches compassion...

5
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
And all paths lead to love.

6
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:28.000
[Islamic call to prayer (Azaan) playing]

7
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:47.000
[Devotional song to Lord Muruga playing in background]

8
00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:04.000
[Amman devotional song playing]

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.500
What happened, brother? What are you doing here?

10
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.000
I don't know, Swami. The vehicle suddenly won't start.

11
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.500
Were you heading somewhere urgently?

12
00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.500
Yes, today is Sunday. I have to go to church.

13
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.500
Then come, the church is on my way. I'll drop you off.

14
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.500
Okay, Swami. Shall I hop on?

15
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.000
Okay, come quickly.

16
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.000
Thank you, Swami. May the Lord bless you.

17
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Brother, there may be many religions in this country.

18
00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.000
But humanity is still the only true religion.

19
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.000
Shall I leave?

20
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.000
See you, Swami.

21
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:48.000
[News Anchor] In a shocking revelation, the CSSS report states that religious riots in India...

22
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.000
...have increased by 84% in the year 2024 alone.

23
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.000
In this story, the Iyer is awakened for his temple pooja by the mosque's call to prayer.

24
00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:06.000
And it is that same Iyer who helps the Christian man reach his church.

25
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.000
Here, knowingly or unknowingly, we are all living in unity.

26
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:16.000
It is only because of the religious politics and conspiracies of a few that things go wrong here.

27
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:22.000
This short film was made to point out such conspiracies and emphasize the need for change.

28
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:28.000
In this short film, we haven't elevated or degraded any religion.

29
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:34.000
If some find it offensive, it is entirely a reflection of their own perspective.

30
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:41.000
Let us look past religion and nurture humanity. Let us foster equality.

31
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:48.000
(Song) The sky is the same color for everyone, isn't it?

32
00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:54.000
This earth we live on has but one heart, doesn't it?

33
00:04:54.500 --> 00:05:00.000
Does the language of tears know religious differences?

34
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:05.500
Is there a boundary line for the sound of laughter?

35
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:11.500
If hands join, wounds will heal.

36
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:19.000
If the heart opens, the darkness will fade away.

37
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:26.000
Enough dividing by caste, enough fighting over religion.

38
00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:31.000
Humanity alone is true life.

39
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:37.500
Enough hating lives, enough breaking relationships.

40
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:44.000
Love is always the solution.
